Including BLEND, USD, FBX and OBJ formats.

Created in Blender v.2.93.5.

7 Sci-Fi Builidings assets pack
This Sci-Fi buildings assets pack is great for set-dressing your future cinematics scene or could be used in your video game project. All the models are unwrapped and textured with some basic tileable PBR materials such as concrete, glass, metal and bitumen roof. 
The assets pack includes:
Models

  - Mega building 01;

  - Mega building 02;

  - Medium building 01;

  - Medium building 02;

  - Medium building 03;

  - Small building 01;

  - Small building 02;

All the models are exported in fbx. file formal, unwrapped and ready to be used.
Textures:

  - Grainy concrete;

  - Bitumen roof;

  - Brushed aluminum;

  - Chromatic windows;

All these textures are exported in png. file format, PBR ready and are 2048x2048 size.
Work Files

  -  Blender scene with all the buildings and assigned correct materials;

  - Marmoset Toolbag 3 render scene with set-up lighting and ready for making some cool renders;

If you have any questions feel free to contact me and I'll happy to help you.
Cheers!

